
AOMP is a development build of ROCm for the ROCm-compiler.
AOMP builds the amd-staging branch of llvm-compliler and hipify with
some set of git checkouts for TheRock submodules.

This directory (aomp/tr_aomp) contains all the support to build AOMP
using TheRock.

Currently, building AOMP with TheRock is experimental. 

The current build process is:

1) ./tr_clone_aomp.sh
   
2) ./tr_build_aomp.sh
   check TheRock/build/build.out

tr_build_aomp.sh builds rocm into $TR_AOMP_REPOS/TheRock/build/dist/rocm.
then copies using rsync from $TR_AOMP_REPOS/TheRock/build/dist/rocm 
to $AOMP_INSTALL_DIR.

These two symlinks help to iterate development of llvm-project. 
ln -sf $TR_AOMP_REPOS/TheRock/compiler/amd-llvm $TR_AOMP_REPOS/llvm-project
ln -sf $TR_AOMP_REPOS/TheRock/build/compiler/amd-llvm/build $TR_AOMP_REPOS/llvm-project/build

llvm-project dev flow: edit, build, install, test
  - cd tr_aomp/llvm-project ; edit llvm-project compiler or runtime sources
  - cd tr_aomp/llvm-project/build ; ninja therock-dist
  - cd tr_aomp/TheRock/build ; rsync -a dist/rocm/ $AOMP_INSTALL_DIR/
  - test AOMP=$HOME/rocm/aomp which is a symlink to $AOMP_INSTALL_DIR 

